OL,3,GNEWSACharity placed in administration
OL,4,Aafter 60 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity that has served its local
OL,7,Fcommunity for almost 60 years has gone
OL,8,Finto administration.
OL,10,FCommunity360 provided transport,
OL,11,Fmobility vehicles, advice and
OL,12,Fnetworking opportunities for people and
OL,13,Forganisations in Essex.
OL,15,FWhile costs scarcely changed, the
OL,16,FColchester-based charity saw its income
OL,17,Fdrop from #5.39m in 2023-24 to #2.76m
OL,18,Fin 2024-25.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
