OL,3,GNEWSACharity placed in administration
OL,4,Aafter 60 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a public statement, the trustees
OL,7,Fsaid it was "with enormous sadness"
OL,8,Fthat the decision had been made
OL,9,F"following a prolonged period of
OL,10,Ffinancial challenges".
